      "comment": "CRAWFORD DREAMER (8) boasts a strong record this journey with three wins and two minors from seven tries. Placed last time (23.67) at this track in a Grade 5, finishing second and beaten 1.5 lengths. Looks a leading chance on best. VELOCITY ZIGGY (4) carved over from wide out and boxed on strongly to finish a neck away in second (24.20) behind Jester Beach at this track. Yet to win out of this box but has been in the placings two times from four starts. Will give a great sight again. WEED MAT (7) was unfancied last time out but hit the ground running to lead all the way, scoring by a nose (23.85) at this track in a Grade 6/MDN over 407m. One of main contenders. BUNKER'S REVIEW (3) looks an each-way chance.",
